Description: A fork of 'ggchicklet' that extends rounded-rectangle styling
    beyond stacked column charts to additional 'ggplot2' geoms such as
    boxplots. Provides 'ggproto'-based geoms that integrate cleanly with
    aesthetics, scales, faceting, and position adjustments.
URL: https://github.com/brooksbenard/ggchicklet2
